# Local AI session transcripts — contain personal paths/emails, not part of the project
session-logs/

# desktop/build/ is electron-builder's `buildResources` dir — hand-written
# SOURCE, not output. The blanket `build/` rule above was hiding the notarize
# afterSign hook and the hardened-runtime entitlements plist, so a fresh clone
# could not produce a signable macOS build at all. (Output goes to desktop/dist/,
# which `dist/` already covers.)
!desktop/build/
# regenerated by `npm run gen:icon` before every build, so it stays out
desktop/build/icon.png

# Hyperframes render scratch — thousands of throwaway frame JPGs per render.
# The watcher committed one of these mid-render last time; excluding it also
# keeps the capture workers' temp dirs out of the tree.
brag-output/work-*/
brag-output/composition/renders/
brag-output/composition/.debug/
